</div><div id="shopify-section-template--15783749976295__product-description" class="shopify-section"><div class="wrapper-padded product-description-container">
  <div class="product-description product-description_full-width rte" itemprop="description">
    <h1>WRAPPED BOUQUET<br>
</h1>
<p><b>Florals arranged and wrapped in craft paper and tied with Wild Things Ribbon. Please let us know what color scheme you'd like in the text box!</b></p>
<p><meta charset="utf-8"><strong>The Goods:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>An arrangement wrapped in paper with a damp sponge around the stems. Great for grab-and-go at pick up, or for a recipient who likes to arrange themselves, or has too many vases at home.<br>
</li>
</ul>
<h2><i>For policies regarding time sensitive deliveries and other information, please reference our <a rel="noopener" title="Policies Page Here!" href="https://wildthingsbhm.com/pages/store-policies?_pos=1&amp;_sid=1400d5d11&amp;_ss=r" target="_blank">Policies Page!</a></i></h2>
<p><strong>*The Fine Print</strong></p>
<p>Wrapped Bouquet pictured is $125 floral budget.</p>
<p>Our promise to you and your recipient is to always send the freshest, highest quality blooms and foliage. Please note that while we cannot guarantee the color or exact flower varieties, we do guarantee that your blooms will be fresh, beautiful and that you or your recipient will love it. For delivery orders, in the instance that your recipient is not home the arrangement will be left on the doorstep and the recipient will be notified.</p>
<p>All photos are taken in our studio of actual arrangements delivered to previous customers.</p>
  </div>
</div>

